text = "20v20 armory skirmish: a larger version of the 10v10 armory demo. Both teams spawn fully clothed and armed with mixed swords, axes, daggers, hatchets, hammers, shields, and peasant/ranger/knight/noble/wizard outfits. Raiders are aggressive and auto-charge; party members are defensive. Use this to watch five-slot crowd combat, group target spreading, surround spacing, and large-fight performance."
